",\"cHXyPLuQFl\":\"Introduction to agentic coding\",\"cKxn2XT2rG\":\"View latest card\",\"cMQMhpROAU\":\"Business Process \u0026 Operations\",\"cPwv2cbzf2\":\"Privacy policy\",\"cZGJUsrgnV\":\"On Team plans, an Owner or Primary Owner manages this under Organization settings \u003e Billing. \u003ca\u003eSee more details here\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"cb2kY6mIKz\":\"Standard\",\"ccXLViZC/1\":\"Category\",\"cfwppHkhgo\":\"{minutes} min\",\"cgAJ/0uxrL\":\"I’ve got a call with Meridian at 2 and I know nothing about it.\",\"chVRqHkSZV\":\"Available to Enterprise users when enabled by an org admin.\",\"chtpmBtB0E\":\"No resources here yet — check back soon.\",\"ctSkb8EVSE\":\"Post to #marketing\",\"cvwrTSWr0m\":\"Action tracking\",\"cyi/ZwsQZR\":\"Interactive visuals\",\"d3pCKHbCKH\":\"Education \u0026 Learning\",\"d9M7UWrt5D\":\"Every Monday morning, pull last week’s views and signups from Amplitude and ad spend from BigQuery, compare to the week before, flag anything that moved more than 10%, and post the readout to #marketing.\",\"dC3u7ZxCFj\":\"Most popular\",\"dCgoDvDFox\":\"Claude in Chrome and Microsoft 365\",\"dG9CoZc8NU\":\"IP allowlisting\",\"dK2xpmCXrt\":\"Webinar registration\",\"dKiMz8lQ7p\":\"Security and administration\",\"dO64AQ4kX2\":\"All Team plan features, plus:\",\"dVx3yznM2C\":\"Memory\",\"dg3jRxBmz9\":\"Video: {title}\",\"dl29r7OlXE\":\"Ability to search the web\",\"dyB+gaZzTJ\":\"Claude Code is included in Claude Pro and Max plans.\",\"dz5w/57op2\":\"Search Claude Marketplace\",\"e3h3Y/N2kI\":\"Related connectors\",\"e480V1RWKN\":\"Customer stories\",\"e61Jf3TcmS\":\"Coming soon\",\"e7sGZ88Qnl\":\"Product: {label}\",\"eGAbmRne5j\":\"Industry Solution Accelerator Deployment\",\"eHY3S25m6z\":\"Chapter navigation\",\"eRr+IfsPTH\":\"The \u003ca\u003eMax plan\u003c/a\u003e is built for people who work with Claude throughout the day and want longer, uninterrupted sessions. You get everything in Pro, plus more usage: choose from 5x or 20x the usage of Pro per 5-hour session. Max also gives you higher output limits. Both options are billed monthly. See the cards above for current pricing.\",\"eW5eoWkxy3\":\"Artifacts\",\"eW9hutaHeF\":\"Check the draft against leveling guide v4\",\"eYENP/pkgh\":\"Software Development\",\"eZPOl0kWMZ\":\"Read the deal thread, Jun 30 – Aug 14\",\"ede6BSFS4Y\":\"Scan your codebase for vulnerabilities, validate findings, and generate suggested patches.\",\"egHChszzD6\":\"{type} access form\",\"ejEGdxSUGs\":\"Home\",\"el7wVC1bkn\":\"Featured resource {position} of {count}: {title}\",\"emgl65lJkN\":\"Organization wide skills deployment\",\"epieNNdeXY\":\"Claude Code is moving our team up a level: we decide what needs to happen, and smooth the process so it can build and verify end-to-end. A big part of my job now is to keep as many instances of Claude Code busy as possible.\",\"euiA1H61OH\":\"Customers outside of Europe can follow this process to \u003ca\u003erequest a refund\u003c/a\u003e:\",\"eylXO8YdWn\":\"Build the slide, comps table behind it\",\"f/P3Iud8AH\":\"Max 20x\",\"f6NhKWst8e\":\"Other plugins\",\"fA/6QacBaf\":\"Prompts \u003e {threshold} tokens\",\"fBG/GeW9Uc\":\"Cost\",\"fC/+2oE3HG\":\"Results for “{query}”\",\"fEE0vf8ygf\":\"Not included\",\"fGpRdLrMdV\":\"Does Claude Code work with the Claude desktop app?\",\"fIg106zNao\":\"slide\",\"fIxDjT+aMY\":\"Splitting decisions from action items first\",\"fJ79V5uNwz\":\"Yes. Max, Pro, Team, and Enterprise users can access Claude Co"])</script><script nonce="Oy54dVBHI+/65io2swoxJQ==">self.__next_f.push([1,"de on the Claude desktop app.\",\"fL3yWFg4Na\":\"Video player\",\"fPBr/eGp6u\":\"Document Processing \u0026 Extraction\",\"fVuTCs6dAD\":\"Related products\",\"fY8+6FRyY8\":\"Incognito chats\",\"fde27wEzOW\":\"Payment options\",\"filwqDWORF\":\"Read\",\"fio5opLcOZ\":\"Output\",\"fkihPk7bb3\":\"All partners\",\"flmC4rLQFi\":\"Advanced filters\",\"fmU7fKJTzY\":\"Claude Training Sessions\",\"fubYuebYh9\":\"Access anywhere\",\"fvA4lXfkP8\":\"Staf