s\",\"hVIGR3ZwM1\":\"Start reading\",\"hcYW3zYnp0\":\"Close {heading}\",\"hccqYXg/9+\":\"For asynchronous workloads that can be processed together for better efficiency\",\"hcoACxj9cD\":\"Enterprise plan includes everything in the Team plan, plus advanced security, data, and user management. \u003ca\u003eLearn more here\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"hgWdf2UIOg\":\"Claude product overview\",\"hiWuJZvDP+\":\"Related articles\",\"hjGm1j2qcj\":\"Work with the files and folders already on your desktop.\",\"hnka4fFkw4\":\"\u003cb\u003eAuto mode by default:\u003c/b\u003e Claude Code now runs in auto mode by default on Pro, Max, and Team plans, so it can work longer while still being designed to catch risky commands.\",\"hnrY3LI/l8\":\"Plugin source\",\"hsFxxRwOuF\":\"Play testimonial audio\",\"hvATMfbD6N\":\"Get started with Claude Code\",\"hvD2/48aAq\":\"Admins set user and org spend limits\",\"hy0YlmzQtV\":\"Share your best chats with your team to spark better ideas and move work forward on the Claude Team and Enterprise plans.\",\"hySAiYaQPB\":\"Customer story: {name}\",\"hzIXh+zWXq\":\"Sign-in\",\"i6/NVPwbXS\":\"Set org instructions\",\"i6X4YUnoI+\":\"Code execution\",\"iA09r91Nhi\":\"Data Analysis \u0026 Business Intelligence\",\"iKZ+rED3h9\":\"Search the Claude Marketplace\",\"iQYFHFpp2/\":\"Start building\",\"iSqBnkauND\":\"Show featured resource {position} of {count}: {title}\",\"iTPvuuEk6M\":\"Anthropic's agentic coding tool for developers. Claude Code understands your codebase, edits files, runs commands, and helps you ship faster.\",\"iUZG3VKE6X\":\"Batch\",\"iXpep1vGVo\":\"Recent\",\"iY7lfhlPVd\":\"Keep context, instructions, and files organized by project.\",\"iYRFrGt6Mf\":\"$$200\",\"iZmBMJrb0b\":\"Create Projects and add knowledge so that you can deliver expert-level results with the Claude Pro, Team and Enterprise plans.\",\"iZxsimeRjv\":\"Play video: {name}\",\"ia3TbSw0MB\":\"Anthropic Products\",\"igUl+YO/B4\":\"Claude takes real actions on your files and in connect