Claude Docs\",\"sXvrJdp5vV\":\"\u003cb\u003eArtifacts:\u003c/b\u003e Preview in-progress work as a live, interactive artifact built from your session context, and share it with your team.\",\"sbCcyNpP/9\":\"Admins set access by team, manage spend limits, and control tool permissions by department. Activity streams to your SIEM through OpenTelemetry.\",\"sdKwU38Eo/\":\"Add the tools {category} teams use every day.\",\"seQIayZV8Q\":\"Claude is a next generation AI assistant built by Anthropic and trained to be safe, accurate, and secure to help you do your best work.\",\"sgTGYsZYPT\":\"Default tier for both piloting and scaling everyday use cases\",\"snqlu2y0xx\":\"On demand\",\"soN6WFjyyQ\":\"Features and capabilities\",\"srwgz/e2SQ\":\"Billing and payments\",\"ssfxGtVpUg\":\"There are three Meridians in the CRM — the health one has a meeting on your calendar today. Want the whole account history, or just what’s changed since the last call?\",\"st9QnC8LFC\":\"Create with Claude\",\"stJYEYsqnV\":\"{current} of {total}\",\"sy7vzf+1SO\":\"Scheduled tasks\",\"szo1Q6XDyE\":\"Team and self-serve Enterprise: an Owner or Primary Owner cancels under \u003ca\u003eOrganization settings \u003e Billing\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"t/JCKd7Rat\":\"Sales \u0026 marketing\",\"t/QGDExlfi\":\"Asset creation\",\"t0clKd0XbN\":\"Windows (arm64)\",\"t31v0g8Oxk\":\"Separating the price beat from the volume story\",\"tF9rgXap+C\":\"Webinar\",\"tFrzx0/fBv\":\"Set up work Claude runs again on a schedule you choose.\",\"tHSb8p10Ty\":\"Desktop\",\"tL5vvEz2a5\":\"What you’ll learn\",\"tN6YfTPvWf\":\"Add to Preferred Sources\",\"tOzrfLgcls\":\"Claude Co"])</script><script nonce="Oy54dVBHI+/65io2swoxJQ==">self.__next_f.push([1,"de can handle routine work like bug fixes and testing, and larger jobs like refactors and new features that are long-running and asynchronous.\",\"tTZcGGL9Ip\":\"Balance availability, performance, and predictable costs based on your needs.\",\"tarJilR3bR\":\"How does Claude Code work with my existing tools?\",\"tf1lIh/bri\":\"Free\",\"thCLWnYR9C\":\"Partner:\",\"tpF1rBQlbd\":\"Other series\",\"tv5FG3fVPd\":\"Blog\",\"txAZOVZLpP\":\"Get up to 2.5x faster speeds with fast mode for Opus 5.5 at 2x standard pricing. \u003ca\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e.\",\"tyUvBVYIqg\":\"Turn the engagement survey export into the exec readout, same shape as last wave.\",\"u1OoLp8wpX\":\"Daily driver for agentic coding and enterprise work\",\"u54zeRyqZw\":\"Enterprise (sales-assisted)\",\"u5XvDTrFab\":\"How is Claude Max different from Pro?\",\"u8g3BII/vI\":\"Use Claude Code where you work\",\"uEHuz5FdGy\":\"Calendar\",\"uX+l4+Y5ZN\":\"Pull web views and sign-ups, Aug 17–23\",\"uXTVe2kYXt\":\"Chats that aren't saved to your history, added to memory, or used to train Claude.\",\"uYh787opQc\":\"Usage credits\",\"ubrk8HaZUC\":\"Pull ad spend by channel\",\"ujPAwMcyiK\":\"Pick a role\",\"urOpUxb/N9\":\"Resources for successful adoption across your institution\",\"uxizPhnuqF\":\"\u003ca\u003eUsage limits apply\u003c/a\u003e. Prices shown don't include applicable tax. Price and plans are subject to change at Anthropic's discretion.\",\"uywgBgBuE8\":\"Scheduled for 7:45am Mondays, before standup\",\"v+4jHj0z9q\":\"Build comparison sheet\",\"v/CiLjmO+2\":\"{title} (opens in new tab)\",\"v1CldtkxV3\":\"Network-level access control\",\"v5OlYwdff3\":\"Triage against the trademark playbook, v4\",\"v9V3eCMg8n\":\"The web\",\"vCO+UdkZFA\":\"Triage issues\",\"vEF59Ugqd6\":\"Guide\",\"vKMj39KhGw\":\"Claude Code\",\"vL82O8vzlo\":\"Request to buy\",\"vMZxqST6IA\":\"Integrate with your editor\",\"vPWmZjju8T\":\" — {title}\",\"vUw2hsGbY1\":\"Webinar series\",\"vYinyg2E+0\":\"Process Redesign\",\"vatCWUigd1\":\"Watch the webinar\",\"vbFKkTYpN+\":\"See plans\",\"vcxsGEi5U7\":\"If you can dream it, Claude can help you do it. Claude can process large amounts of information, brainstorm ideas, generate text and code, help you understand subjects, coach you through difficult situations, simpl